# Local SQLite database (created and seeded on first run)
# Anchored to the repo root on purpose: an unanchored "data/" also matches
# LifeTodo.Api/Data/, and "*.db" matches the LifeTodo.Db project, because git
# compares paths case-insensitively on Windows.
/data/

